  "caption": "Spend the year out here.\n\nPriya and Sam under the cherry blossoms in April. Ana and Leo barefoot on the beach in July. The Reyes family in the fall leaves in October. Noor and her dog at a snowy cabin in December.\nAll year, the next client is already on the way: an inquiry from your contact form, a booking from your booking page, a contract signed in the browser, an invoice paid into your own Stripe. It all lands in one Snap inbox.\nSnap takes 0% commission.\n\nIt is not magic: you still reply to the inquiry and send the contract and the invoice. Snap just keeps every reply and payment in one place.\n\nStart free at snaphq.app",
